#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/srcdir.rst:17
msgid ""
"The base path where PlatformIO should look for library source code. The "
"default value is ``src`` and indicates that folder is located in the root of "
"the library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/srcdir.rst:21
msgid ""
"Setting ``srcDir`` to ``.`` will instruct PlatformIO to recursively build "
"all source files located in the root of the library and its subfolders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../manifests/library-json/fields/build/srcdir.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you need to exclude some files from the build process, refer to the :ref:"
"`library_json_buid_src_filter`."
msgstr ""

